    and it is not the case that the iou is an iou with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, currency a currency, amount an amount and observers party list an observers party list.

% Iou.Iou_Split (consuming): the controller (owner) must submit it, and the contract must be active
when a party exercises split on the iou an iou with split amount a split amount creating a second iou and a third iou
    and the iou is an iou with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, currency a currency, amount an amount and observers party list an observers party list
then the second iou is an iou with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, currency the currency, amount the split amount and observers party list the observers party list
    and it is not the case that the iou is an iou with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, currency the currency, amount the amount and observers party list the observers party list.

when a party exercises split on the iou an iou with split amount a split amount creating a second iou and a third iou
    and the iou is an iou with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, currency a currency, amount a second amount and observers party list an observers party list
    and an amount = second amount - split amount
then the third iou is an iou with issuer the issuer, owner the owner, currency the currency, amount the amount and observers party list the observers party list.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the iou an iou with split amount a split amount creating a second iou and a third iou
    and the iou is an iou with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, currency a currency, amount an amount and observers party list an observers party list
    and the party is different from the owner.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the iou an iou with split amount a split amount creating a second iou and a third iou
    and it is not the case that the iou is an iou with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, currency a currency, amount an amount and observers party list an observers party list.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the iou an iou with split amount a split amount creating a second iou and a third iou
    and the iou is an iou with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, currency a currency, amount an amount and observers party list an observers party list
    and the split amount <= 0.0.

it must not be true that
    a party exercises split on the iou an iou with split amount a split amount creating a second iou and a third iou
    and the iou is an iou with issuer an issuer, owner an owner, currency a currency, amount an amount and observers party list an observers party list
    and amount - split amount <= 0.0.

